[0.009085, "o", "\u001b[1;36m$ claude\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m> PROMPT:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.010939, "o", "  Read CLAUDE.md. Add the FilterBar and finish the product.\r\n  \r\n  1. FilterBar: country multi-select (searchable dropdown listing only countries present in data), region quick chips, \"Max tuition / year\" slider, \"Max total cost / year\" slider (tuition+living), and a \"Show reach schools\" toggle. Filters apply live via useMemo — no page reload.\r\n  2. Currency formatting ($12,300) and a compact \"≈ total / yr\" line on every card.\r\n  3. Sort control: Best match (default), Lowest total cost, Ranking.\r\n  4. Empty-results state with a \"Relax filters\" reset button.\r\n  5. Mobile: filters collapse into a bottom sheet toggled by a \"Filters\" button with an active-filter count badge.\r\n  6. Polish pass: hover states, focus rings, subtle card entrance animation, print-friendly light @media print styles.\r\n  7. `npm run build` and `npm run test` must pass.\r\n"]
[0.011436, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m--- Claude Code session start ---\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[303.696239, "o", "Everything is wired correctly. `npm run build` and `npm run test` both pass. I attempted to spin up a local server to visually verify in a browser, but the sandbox blocked starting background/server processes without interactive approval — you can run `npm run dev` locally to see it live.\r\n\r\nSummary of what was added on top of the existing scaffold:\r\n\r\n1. **FilterBar** — country filter is now a searchable dropdown (`CountrySelect` in `FilterBar.jsx`) listing only countries present in the data, with selected-country chips below it; region chips, both sliders, and the reach toggle were already present and remain live via `useMemo` in `App.jsx`.\r\n2. **Currency + compact total line** — `UniversityCard` now shows `≈ $X total/yr` under the location line, alongside the existing formatted cost breakdown.\r\n3. **Sort control** — added to `ResultsGrid` (Best match / Lowest total cost / Ranking), applied via a new `sortedResults` `useMemo` in `App.jsx`.\r\n4. **Empty-results state** — `NoResults` now includes a \"Relax filters\" button wired to a new `resetFilters()` in `App.jsx`.\r\n5. **Mobile bottom sheet** — a \"Filters\" toggle button with an active-filter-count badge, backdrop, slide-up sheet (CSS `transform`/`display: contents` swap at `max-width: 640px`), close button, and Escape-key handling.\r\n6. **Polish** — card entrance animation (`@keyframes card-enter`, respects `prefers-reduced-motion`), `:focus-visible` rings on buttons/chips/sliders/links, and `@media print` rules (light background, hides interactive chrome, avoids card page-breaks).\r\n7. Both `npm run build` and `npm run test` pass.\r\n"]
[303.927789, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m--- session complete (exit 0) ---\u001b[0m\r\n"]
